[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4794600799","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120621#issuecomment-4794600799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120621","id":4794600799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHcfNXw","user":{"login":"friguron","id":3338420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzg0MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3338420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron","html_url":"https://github.com/friguron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-24T23:53:53Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T12:58:50Z","body":"I was facing the same situation, and then I discovered that I had to launch the godot binary like this for it not to crash:\n\n./Godot_4.7.app/Contents/MacOS/Godot --rendering-driver opengl3\n\nYou can also edit your project.godot file and change the rendering section with something like this for godot binary to boot past the project selector screen:\n\n[rendering]\nrenderer/rendering_method=\"gl_compatibility\"\nrenderer/rendering_method.mobile=\"gl_compatibility\"\n\nMy original rendering section, the one that works perfectly with Godot 4.6 and crashes Godot 4.7 was:\n\n[rendering]\nrenderer/rendering_method=\"mobile\"\n\nIn any case, it's still a bug to me...\n\nMy graphical specs are these (yep, it's a hackintosh but still, Godot 4.6 works flawlessly with it):\nMacOS Version: Sequoia 15.7.5\nGraphics: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 770, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 770, PCIe, 2 GB\nDisplay: SyncMaster, 1920 x 1200 (WUXGA - Widescreen Ultra eXtended Graphics Array), Main, MirrorOff, Online\n\nEDIT: From my \"System Description\" under sequoia, I have this additional data:\n\n```\nNVIDIA GeForce GTX 770:\n\n  Chipset Model:\tNVIDIA GeForce GTX 770\n  Type:\tGPU\n  Bus:\tPCIe\n  Slot:\tSlot-1\n  PCIe Bandwidth:\tx16\n  VRAM (total):\t2 GB\n  Manufacturer:\tNVIDIA (0x10de)\n  Device ID:\t0x1184\n  Revision ID:\t0x00a2\n  ROM Revision:\tVBIOS 80.04.e6.00.10\n  Metal Compatibility:\tMetal 2\n\nScreens:\nSyncMaster:\n  Resolution:\t1920 x 1200 (WUXGA - Widescreen Ultra eXtended Graphics Array)\n  UI Aspect:\t1920 x 1200 @ 60.00Hz\n  Framebuffer depth:\t24 Bit Color (ARGB8888)\n  Main Screen:\tYes\n  Duplication:\tDisabled\n  Online:\tYes\n  Rotation:\tCompatible\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4794600799/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4797786124","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120621#issuecomment-4797786124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120621","id":4797786124,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHfhoDA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-25T09:31:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T09:31:01Z","body":"To be clear this is not happening in 4.6?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4797786124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4797873654","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120621#issuecomment-4797873654","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120621","id":4797873654,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHfm99g","user":{"login":"friguron","id":3338420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzg0MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3338420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron","html_url":"https://github.com/friguron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/friguron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.gi