 macOS 13+, older versions should use Vulkan. There's probably a missing check.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4902060234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4902144722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120621#issuecomment-4902144722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120621","id":4902144722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJDDK0g","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T09:13:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:13:03Z","body":"> MacOS Version: Sequoia 15.7.5\n> Graphics: NVIDIA GeForce GTX 770, NVIDIA GeForce GTX 770, PCIe, 2 GB\n> Display: SyncMaster, 1920 x 1200 (WUXGA - Widescreen Ultra eXtended Graphics Array), Main, MirrorOff, Online \n\nThis is unrelated, Intel only supports Vulkan (MoltenVK), your issue might be related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120973","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4902144722/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4902355961","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120621#issuecomment-4902355961","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120621","id":4902355961,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJDQD-Q","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T09:39:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:39:02Z","body":"> Metal renderer require macOS 13+, older versions should use Vulkan. There's probably a missing check.\n\nIt's not starting in macOS 12 VM with other renderers as well, so something about Metal loading was changed and it is no longer lazy linking it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4902355961/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4902422730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120621#issuecomment-4902422730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120621","id":4902422730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJDUIyg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-07T09:46:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T09:46:51Z","body":"Broken since `4.7.dev1`, likely result of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114484 which broke lazy loading by switching from Obj-C to C++ code.\n\nEvery Apple Silicon mac support macOS 26 / 27, and versions older than macOS 15 no longer get security updates, so we probably should bump min. version to 13 for Apple Silicon.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4902422730/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]